│ {'chunk_payload': '{"title": "Rapid point of care test for detecting urogenital   Chlamydia trachomatis infection in │
│ nonpregnant women and men at reproductive age", "objective": "To determine the diagnostic accuracy of rapid          │
│ point‐of‐care (POC) testing for detecting urogenital C trachomatis infection in nonpregnant women and men of         │
