- Studies from diverse geographic locations were included (USA, Guatemala, Suriname, Indonesia, South Africa, UK, 
Colombia)

**Notable Observations:**
- Many excluded studies were reviews or guidelines rather than primary research
- Several prevalence studies were excluded as they did not evaluate POC test accuracy
- Two studies had medium confidence ratings (Studies 28 and 31) due to less clear information about reference standard 
or 2x2 data presentation
- The included studies represent a good geographic diversity and include both symptomatic and asymptomatic populations
- Some included studies (e.g., Study 46) reported poor POC test performance, but this does not affect inclusion 
eligibility

